                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Performance</strong> - Slight performance benefit</li>
                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Design</strong> - Class is complete, no need for changes</li>
                                                    <li>✅ <strong>Protection</strong> - Prevent misuse of your class</li>
